    {
      "type": "hero",
      "id": "hero",
      "title": "Travel to the Technical Center",
      "body": [
        "The I-CAR Chicago Technical Center in Vernon Hills, Illinois, is about 30 miles north of downtown Chicago and close to O'Hare International Airport.",
        "The facility expands I-CAR's technical resources with state-of-the-art labs for ADAS, EVs, and Welding, along with modern classrooms and a Learning Design Studio. Built by I-CAR for the industry, it provides an ideal setting for training, collaboration, and advancing collision repair innovation."
      ],
